(7404135, 1166139, 16912, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump +2<br/> <br/>ok, this is how it went, after voting several images that didn''t really meet (my interpretation of the challenge) this popped up very slowly on my screen.<br/> <br/>As it loaded I was thinking, nice colours, well focused/exposed, is their a bird in the trees I should be noticing?<br/> <br/>Then the sign appeared and guessed as it was hard to read it was ''obscure''.<br/> <br/>Then I read the title and WHAM it hit me in the face!<br/> <br/>I''m going out on a limb here (if you excuse the pun) but, is this a sp and do you have a black and white hand?</td>', 'Back to comment and bump +2 ok, this is how it went, after voting several images that didn''t really meet (my interpretation of the challenge) this popped up very slowly on my screen. As it loaded I was thinking, nice colours, well focused/exposed, is their a bird in the trees I should be noticing? Then the sign appeared and guessed as it was hard to read it was ''obscure''. Then I read the title and WHAM it hit me in the face! I''m going out on a limb here (if you excuse the pun) but, is this a sp and do you have a black and white hand?', '2015-09-11 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
